1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[Killua] Been a while
since I flipped my switch on.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
[neck cracks]

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
[Gon] Scissors!

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,000
[gunshot]

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,000
[thudding]

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
[Rammot] Hey there, Colt. Check this out.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
It almost feels like I've been reborn!

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
[opening theme music playing]

9
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
[singer singing in English]

11
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

12
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
[singer singing in English]

13
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,000
INSPIRATION X TO X EVOLVE

14
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
[Netero] There have
already been many casualties.

15
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:43,000
We will proceed using any means necessary.

16
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Will that be acceptable to you?

17
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,000
[politician] Well, yes, of course.

18
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,000
We wouldn't dream
of telling the experts how to proceed.

19
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:56,000
All we desire now
is for those dangerous creatures

20
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
to be eradicated
as swiftly and humanely as possible.

21
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,000
[Netero] Yes, of course. I understand.

22
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
[line disconnects]

23
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,000
So their goal is to eradicate the ants.

24
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:11,000
Leaving the Hunter Association
to take the blame for the fallout.

25
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,000
I get it.

26
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,000
[keyboard clacking]

27
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:21,000
[Lin] The hierarchy
inside of a Chimera Ant colony

28
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,000
has five total ranks,
with the queen at the very top.

29
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
[both grunt]

30
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,000
[Stick] There's the queen.

31
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Right under her is the Royal Guard,
and then the squadron leaders.

32
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,000
That's correct.

33
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:54,000
And after the king is born,
the hierarchy will shift, just like this.

34
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,000
[Lin] And afterwards,
all the squadron leaders

35
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,000
will report directly to the queen,

36
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000
[Spin groans]
No wonder they spread so fast.

37
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,000
[Stick] That's a tall order.

38
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,000
[cell phone vibrating]

39
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,000
Mmm.

40
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,000
[pops]

41
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,000
[Rammot] Look at this! [laughs]

42
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:44,000
Isn't it just incredible?

43
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
[gagging]

44
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:08,000
[groaning] It hurts!

45
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,000
-Peggy.
-Uh-huh.

46
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:27,000
Remember when I said
we're capable of anything humans are?

47
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,000
Including this bizarre power?

48
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,000
But… but this is…

49
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:48,000
You've really been pissing me off lately,
so I won't hold back.

50
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,000
It may need to be quite hard
to take effect.

51
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,000
[Rammot grunts]

52
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,000
[Colt gulps]

53
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,000
[yelling]

54
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[gasps]

55
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:30,000
This is a message from Hagya.

56
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Capture them.

57
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Capture them.

58
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
Dead or alive.

59
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:14,000
"Pretty good fight," huh? I hope so.

60
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:18,000
I'd like to agree, but I really doubt
they're gonna be much help.

61
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,000
[Leol] I'm fine with that.

62
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,000
You are? Why's that?

63
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,000
Because they'll buy a little time
until we can get there.

64
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,000
[Hina] Oh. I see.

65
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:32,000
Well, if that's the case, then the Rares
will be ours for the taking.

66
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:35,000
[Leol grunts] Exactly.

67
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,000
[Kite] We're surrounded.

68
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,000
And by a lot of them, too.

69
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,000
[gasps]

70
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:05,000
Three, surrender and let us capture you.

71
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,000
You may even survive.

72
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,000
I don't recommend the second option.

73
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:19,000
If that is the choice you make,
you will only anger us,

74
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:39,000
Now then, what will you do?

75
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,000
[Gon] Kite.

76
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
We couldn't have asked for a better deal.

77
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,000
[boys grunt]

78
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,000
[boys grunt]

79
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:59,000
[both] Show me rock!

80
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,000
Rock-paper-scissors!

81
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Okay. I'm going first.

82
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:34,000
I only hope that we'll be able
to take full advantage of that.

83
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Number six.

84
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:44,000
It's six! who has it?

85
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,000
[Baro laughs] Lucky me.

86
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,000
[Baro] Huh? It's obvious, isn't it?

87
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Whoever dies loses.

88
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,000
Are you crazy, kid?

89
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,000
If you lose, then we're just
gonna feed you to the Queen.

90
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Fine. I can agree to that.

91
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:23,000
But you don't have to die
if you're the one who ends up losing this.

92
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:27,000
-If i win, I'm not gonna eat you.
-[growling]

93
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Damn it! You dodged that one.

94
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:04,000
All right, fine!

95
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,000
Then how about this?

96
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,000
[Killua] The same attack?

97
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:42,000
Whatever. I could keep this up
all day long,

98
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:45,000
but you'll never be able
to dodge my homing attacks.

99
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,000
[Kite] He's right.

100
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:54,000
He only has to change his course
to match the direction Gon dodges.

101
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,000
Well, Gon, what will you do?

102
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Listen up. There's something
you should know before you die.

103
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:07,000
The main reason that we kill humans
isn't so we can eat them ourselves,

104
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
or even so we can feed them to the Queen.

105
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,000
[yelling]

106
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,000
[yelling]

107
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,000
[screaming]

108
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,000
Who's my opponent?

109
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:48,000
Number three. Number three's up!

110
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Settle down.

111
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:53,000
You're too cocky for your own good.

112
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,000
I'm about to show you
what hell looks like.

113
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Got that? Don't lump me in
with trash like him.

114
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,000
[grunts]

115
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:10,000
Come on. I'm at least
ten times stronger than that guy.

116
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:13,000
[Killua] Okay. So, not much, then.

117
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,000
They're suited for this.

118
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:29,000
Gon's slow start
does make me a bit anxious.

119
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,000
It's like I'm missing something.

120
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:55,000
There's a gnawing anxiety
that won't go away.

121
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,000
[Rammot] Check this out, Peggy!

122
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,000
[scoffs]

123
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,000
-You're such a stiff, you know that?
-[slap]

124
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,000
Give me a break.

125
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,000
[Colt] Zazan… [breathing heavily]

126
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:41,000
A few days ago, she told me
that she had captured a Rare.

127
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,000
[breathing heavily]

128
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:49,000
If we're lucky,
he might still be in the storeroom.

129
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:54,000
Find it, and secure it.

130
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:30,000
Keep it up. I can take as many
of those attacks as you've got.

131
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,000
Oh, really?

132
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,000
[grunting, groaning]

133
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,000
[groans]

134
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,000
[all murmuring]

135
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:04,000
[Kite] What a pleasant surprise.

136
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:06,000
Their officers can be dispatched easily.

137
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:09,000
Maybe I'm worrying over nothing.

138
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:12,000
Let's find out.

139
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:16,000
-[can rattling]
-[Frog] That's enough. It's my turn.

140
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:38,000
[Killua] Mmm. That scythe, it's bad news.

141
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,000
[both gasp]

142
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:52,000
[Frog whimpers] What is this?
Why do I feel so scared?

143
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:01,000
Yes, that's right.

144
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:05,000
I think I've experienced
this sensation before.

145
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:31,000
I remember now.

146
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,000
[Queen bites]

147
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,000
[Killua] Yeah, so why did you
make it that way?

148
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:17,000
[Kite] Be careful as we advance.

149
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:20,000
Like I told you before,
they're still alive for a little while.

150
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,000
You okay?

151
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:29,000
Because it's only going to get worse
from here on.

152
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:33,000
If you're thinking about the enemy,
you won't be able to last mentally.

153
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,000
I'm all right.

154
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:39,000
I don't have any sympathy for guys
like him who call each other trash.

155
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,000
[Kite] That's the problem.

156
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
with one singular mission on their minds:

157
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,000
Preventing the birth of the king.

158
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,000
[Leol grunts]

159
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,000
[closing theme music playing]

160
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

161
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:36,000
[Gon] Next time, "A Fated Awakening".

162
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:38,000
-[Killua] I'll go.
-[Gon] No, I will.

163
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
-[Killua] No, me!
-[Hina] Then I'll go.

164
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Gon and Killua] Oh, please, go ahead.

165
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
